    "html": "<b>options</b>: is handed to localeCompare. <i>{numeric: true}</i> compares digit runs by value, so 10 follows 2 instead of 1. The buttons leave <b>key</b> out, so its default <i>\"value\"</i> applies — the counters carry it as text."
  },
